{"id":"632905","name":"发面馅饼","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"","cover":"images/632905/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"400g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"300g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"4g"}],"sub":[{"name":"韭菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋炒碎晾凉，加花板粉、虾皮、生抽、香油、鸡精、五香粉、玉米油、盐和匀。","img":"images/632905/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入韭菜碎，再加点玉米油和匀。","img":"images/632905/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面粉＋酵母＋温水＋少许玉米油和好发酵了。","img":"images/632905/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"馅和好。","img":"images/632905/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"手套上沾点油揪一块面，放上馅料。","img":"images/632905/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"包上。","img":"images/632905/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入平底锅，锅中放好油，煎烙。","img":"images/632905/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"至两面金黄。","img":"images/632905/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632905/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}